+# Wurtle Lottie animations
+
+These animations use the real WiseAI Wurtle PNG from the repo, not a separate vector recreation.
+
+Base image:
+- Source: `wiseai-landing/public/logo.png`
+- App source copy: `assets/images/wurtle-base.png`
+- Runtime copy: `public/images/wurtle-base.png`
+
+Each Lottie JSON contains a Bodymovin image layer referencing `/images/wurtle-base.png`, with motion/effect layers around the actual mascot image.
